Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.43,0:04:53.98,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}瞼を閉じても
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.23,0:04:59.52,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}まだ潮風肌に残る
